>**Increase Nation's Reconnaissance.**
=2 Walkthrough
* Accept the mission from {n:Emhi Tchaoryo}. Select __Intel Gathering__, then __Prying Eyes II__.
* Travel to either {z:Castle Zvahl Baileys (S)} or {z:Castle Zvahl Keep (S)} and find two {p:???} in the chosen zone. The zone selected must be under beastmen control.
* The {p:Survival Guide} placed in Castle Zvahl Baileys (S) (J-8 on the first map, near the entrance) or the {p:Home Point} placed in Castle Zvahl Keep (S) (G-7 on the fourth map, near the zone to {z:Throne Room (S)}) may be utilized to facilitate transit to these locations.

=2 Castle Zvahl Baileys (S)
* One is located at (H-7) of the second map, near a Zvahl Fortilace spawn location.
* The other is at (H-7) of the third map, also near a Zvahl Fortilace spawn location. Getting there requires you to drop down a circular pit on the second map, onto a ledge below (drop from the southwest edge of the pit at (H-7)).

=2 Castle Zvahl Keep (S)
* One is located at (H-9) of the second map (second floor, south side of the balcony overlooking the first big room).
* The other is located at (H-9) on the third map (south side of the lower floor in the room with the teleporters, located behind a Zvahl Fortalice spawn).

* Unlike Hawk Eye, the intel gathering is instantaneous, although you will still need to drop {s:Sneak} and {s:Invisible}.
* Report back to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo} to complete the mission.

=2 Objective
Our tactical officers are in need of accurate information on our enemy's defenses to employ in the siege on Castle Zvahl.
\**Unit Requirement:** 1 member
